/T (Defect 1 \(balances do not change\): addInterest\(struct account a, ...\) receives the structure by value. C makes a copy of list[i], the interest is added to the copy, and the copy is thrown away when the function ends. The original in main\(\) is never touched.)
/E (Defect 1 \(balances do not change\): addInterest\(struct account a, ...\) receives the structure by value. C makes a copy of list[i], the interest is added to the copy, and the copy is thrown away when the function ends. The original in main\(\) is never touched.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [56]
>>
